Source: qoder
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), binutils, xz-utils, zstd
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://qoder.com

Package: qoder
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libasound2t64, libatk-bridge2.0-0t64, libatk1.0-0t64, libatspi2.0-0t64, libcairo2, libcups2t64, libdbus-1-3, libexpat1, libgbm1, libgcc-s1, libglib2.0-0t64, libgtk-3-0t64, libnotify4, libnss3, libnspr4, libpango-1.0-0, libpipewire-0.3-0t64, libpulse0, libsecret-1-0, libstdc++6, libudev1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb1, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxkbcommon0, libxrandr2, libxcursor1, xdg-utils
Description: Qoder agent workbench
 Qoder is an agent workbench for human and AI software teams. This package
 re-packs the upstream Electron 43 (Chromium 150) .deb payload under /opt/Qoder.
